  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      54.0,
      140.42,
      547.14,
      202.94
    ],
    "text": "The Depression that was located over the Northwest Bay of Bengal has now intensified into a Deep Depression and is currently located over the same area, approximately 1,000 km northeast of the island. The system is very likely to move further west-northwestwards and cross the coastal areas of northern Andhra Pradesh and southern Odisha, India.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
